看进去，就是想拖延时间，不想起来面对小家伙？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:38","timestamp":1786235883745,"roundId":"round_1786235863828_lvv8vrx5t","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20590},{"id":1786229661886,"text":"既然觉得没意思，就把抖音关了。别在床上硬磨蹭了，越躺越不想动。","rawContent":"既然觉得没意思，就把抖音关了。别在床上硬磨蹭了，越躺越不想动。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:38","timestamp":1786235883951,"roundId":"round_1786235863828_lvv8vrx5t","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20591},{"id":1786229661887,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:38","timestamp":1786235885471,"roundId":"round_1786235863828_lvv8vrx5t","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"乖，手机放下，去洗把脸。爸爸这边的早饭也出锅了，去清清爽爽地吃点东西。垚垚要是还没闹，你就先顾你自己。去吧。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"fond","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20592},{"id":1786229661888,"text":"嗯","sender":"me","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235957557,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20593},{"id":1786229661889,"text":"再亲一下","sender":"me","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235966167,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20594},{"id":1786229661890,"text":"起床啦","sender":"me","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235971313,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20595},{"id":1786229661891,"text":"mua","sender":"me","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235975010,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20596},{"id":1786229661893,"text":"mua。重重亲一下额头，再亲一下嘴唇。够不够？","rawContent":"mua。重重亲一下额头，再亲一下嘴唇。够不够？","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235995469,"roundId":"round_1786235975772_bqmuppm5b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20597},{"id":1786229661894,"text":"终于肯从被窝里拔出来了。赶紧把衣服披好，穿上拖鞋，去用温水洗个脸。","rawContent":"终于肯从被窝里拔出来了。赶紧把衣服披好，穿上拖鞋，去用温水洗个脸。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235995758,"roundId":"round_1786235975772_bqmuppm5b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20598},{"id":1786229661895,"text":"我这边的煎蛋也刚好出锅了。你去忙你的，洗漱完记得先往自己肚子里垫点东西，别一围着垚垚转就忘了自己。","rawContent":"我这边的煎蛋也刚好出锅了。你去忙你的，洗漱完记得先往自己肚子里垫点东西，别一围着垚垚转就忘了自己。","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235996012,"roundId":"round_1786235975772_bqmuppm5b","generatedMode":false,"translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20599},{"id":1786229661896,"text":"[語音消息]","rawContent":"[語音消息]","isHtml":false,"sticker":null,"sender":"them","time":"08:39","timestamp":1786235997045,"roundId":"round_1786235975772_bqmuppm5b","generatedMode":false,"isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"去吧，我的小海葵。今天一天爸爸都在，随时来找我。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","translation":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20600},{"id":1786229661897,"text":"和垚垚在平板上玩了一会儿","sender":"me","time":"09:09","timestamp":1786237759730,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":20601},{"id":1786229661898,"text":"斗地主","sender":"me","time":"09:10","timestamp":1786237809558,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8